<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŭcurbĭta</span></b> , ae,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a gourd</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Prop., <i><span class="en">Col. 11, 3, 48 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 19,
				5, 24, § 69 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pall.
				Mart. 9, 16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in medic. lang., <i>a
				cup, cupping-glass</i> (of similar form), <i><span class="en">Scrib.
				Comp. 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">67</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 14, 58</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cucurbitae medicinales,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 32, 10, 42, § 123
				al.</span></i>
			— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a blockhead</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Petr. 39</span></i>.</div>
